			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 762020901,
					"content": "Paimon can't help but wonder why you're so excited about these rewards, Nicole...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020902
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020902,
					"content": "#Sure, Paimon looks forward to {NICKNAME}'s reaction when she gets {M#him}{F#her} a gift, but this feels kinda different...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020903
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020903,
					"content": "What did I tell you about gift horses, Paimon...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020904
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 762020904,
					"content": "Oh, don't worry about that. I don't mind! At worst, my answer might shatter a few illusions you have about the angelic race. If you thought we were all selfless, benevolent beings, the truth may make you think again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020905
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020905,
					"content": "As for your question, my dearest Paimon, my excitement has nothing to do with sharing the joy of those I guide. Instead, it derives from completing the duties I am burdened with.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020906
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020906,
					"content": "Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020907
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020907,
					"content": "It all started with the birth of the angels...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020908
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020908,
					"content": "We were entrusted with the mission to love all living beings on this land, but unlike the gods who came after...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020909
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020909,
					"content": "...Our ability to perceive emotion was crude and undeveloped. Most of the time, we simply executed our orders from above, like automatons following commands.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020910
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020910,
					"content": "Aside from \"enlightenment,\" \"guidance\" was our primary mission. It was one of the few instincts retained by my former peers after they were stripped of their wisdom.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020911
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020911,
					"content": "Upon completing our missions, we gained a certain sense of joyous relief. It was the most intense emotional experience an angel could normally undergo.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020912
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020912,
					"content": "Isn't that... kinda sad?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020913
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020913,
					"content": "Maybe, but I prefer not to think of it as something worthy of pity. After all, not even the great ruler of the firmament can deny the truth of the emotions in my heart right now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						762020914
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				},
				{
					"id": 762020914,
					"content": "Besides, guiding others is a good thing in itself, don't you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Nicole"
				}
			]
		},
